The `13e4c76eb9c64f5ebbc92dd2c0a1d2b0` is the value of your `ds_session_id` cookie – it’s the **session token**, not a chat conversation ID. You don’t need it to start a new chat; it’s automatically used by the site to authenticate you. The script’s `--session <ID>` flag is for continuing an **existing conversation** (the ID you see in the URL like `/a/chat/s/abc123`). For a fresh chat, just omit the flag.

