- Hides `navigator.webdriver`
- Sets `Accept-Language` and other headers to match a real mobile browser
- Disables automation flags

If this still fails, we’ll use a **one‑time manual login** inside a visible browser – which you can do right on your phone via a VNC session (I’ll include that fallback).

