pkg install termux-x11 openbox
```

### 3. Start the Termux:X11 app
Open the **Termux:X11** app from your launcher.  
It will show a blank screen – that’s normal. Leave it running in the background.

### 4. In Termux, set up the display and window manager
```bash
# Start the X server connection
termux-x11 :0 &
sleep 2
# Start a simple window manager (Openbox)
openbox &
# Tell GUI apps where to draw
