## 1. Why a new session was created

When you used `--session a047d1db...`, the script navigated to that URL, but **it didn’t verify that the page stayed there**. If the session ID was invalid (or the page redirected), you ended up in a new chat. The fix: after loading the session URL, we check that the current URL still contains the same ID. If not, we abort.

