## 3. New Flags & Features

| Flag | Description |
|------|-------------|
| `--system-prompt "text"` | Inject a system instruction prepended to every request. |
| `--system-prompt-file path` | Load system prompt from a file. |
| `--retry` | Automatically retry on “server busy” errors (enabled by default now). |
| `--log` | Print the local chat history file. |
| `--list` | Shows both live sidebar sessions and the local log. |
| `--loop` | Continuous chat in same session, with full logging. |

**Local history** is stored in `chat-history.json`:
```json
{
  "session-id": {
    "title": "Chat title",
    "messages": [
      { "role": "user", "content": "...", "edited": false, "time": 1712345678000 },
      { "role": "assistant", "content": "...", "time": 1712345679000 }
    ]
  }
}
```
Edits are tracked: when you use `--edit`, the last user message’s `edited` field becomes `true` and its content is updated.

