## 4. Usage Examples

```bash
# Start a new chat with a system prompt
node deepseek.js --system-prompt "You are a code merge expert" "How do I rebase?"

# Continue a session, edit the last user message
node deepseek.js --session abc123 --edit "How do I squash commits?"

# Loop mode with system prompt and auto-retry
node deepseek.js --session abc123 --loop --system-prompt-file ~/merge-instructions.txt

# View your entire chat history
node deepseek.js --log

# List sessions (live + local)
node deepseek.js --list
```

The script now intercepts every API call, prepends your system prompt, captures the raw SSE stream, auto‑retries on errors, and logs everything to a local journal. You’re fully equipped for serious code‑merge sessions.

