## ✅ What We’ve Built

| Feature | Implementation |
|---------|---------------|
| **File upload** | Native UI click on paperclip (`f02f0e25`), handles POW transparently. |
| **System prompt injection** | Monkey‑patched `fetch` prepends system message. |
| **SSE stream capture** | Parses `data:` lines from the completion API response. |
| **Auto‑retry** | Detects “server busy” and clicks the retry button automatically. |
| **Local chat history** | Logs every message with edits and timestamps to `chat-history.json`. |
| **Session persistence** | Reuses authenticated profile, no cookies needed after first login. |
| **Expert mode enforcement** | Clicks the Expert radio at session start. |
| **Edit & resend** | `--edit` clicks the pencil on the last user message. |
| **Loop mode** | Continuous prompting in the same session. |
| **List sessions** | Shows sidebar titles and local history entries. |

This is now a complete, headless DeepSeek CLI that handles file attachments without API keys or browser toggles.  
