## 🔄 What Changed & Why

- **`uploadFile` now waits** for the actual upload API response (`/api/v0/file/upload_file`) using a one‑time response listener. This ensures the file is fully uploaded before we proceed.
- **`sendMessage` now watches** for the page URL to change after sending (a new chat navigates to `/a/chat/s/<id>`). This gives us a reliable session ID even if the initial URL was just `chat.deepseek.com`.
- Removed the premature session‑ID capture before sending; we now capture it **after** the message is sent.

