## What This Script Does Better

| Improvement | Explanation |
|-------------|-------------|
| **File upload** | Uses `page.waitForFileChooser()` after clicking the paperclip – works reliably even in headless mode. |
| **System prompt** | Checks if `body.messages` is an array before inserting, avoiding crashes. |
| **Reply state reset** | Clears `__deepseekReplyReady` before each send so you never get a stale reply. |
| **Session ID capture** | Waits for the page URL to change after send (new chats get an ID in the path). |
| **Auto‑retry** | Uses the exact `RETRY_BTN_SEL` and resets state before clicking retry. |

