```

The `x-ds-pow-response` header contains a fresh POW solution. It’s **valid for a short time**, but we can solve a new challenge when needed (or use the page’s built‑in solver if we find it). However, the UI upload (via `fileChooser`) already handles all of this automatically – we don’t need to manually recreate the request unless we want to bypass the UI entirely.

